      <h2>What we collect.</h2>
      <p>When you book a job, we collect your name, phone, email, address, and what you've described about the work. On-site we add panel photos and load-calc data. For the EV-charger jobs, we add vehicle make/model and the charger spec.</p>
      <p>The site has no behavioral analytics, no fingerprinting scripts, no third-party cookies, no remarketing pixels. Page views are counted via Cloudflare Web Analytics, which doesn't set cookies and can't identify individuals.</p>

      <h2>How we use it.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To quote, schedule, and dispatch.</li>
        <li>To pull permits with the city of Fort Collins.</li>
        <li>To file utility coordination paperwork (Xcel, Poudre Valley REA).</li>
        <li>To stay in touch about warranty work for the year after install.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we never do.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sell your data.</li>
        <li>Add you to a marketing list without explicit opt-in.</li>
        <li>Share your panel photos with anyone except city inspectors and your utility (when required for the permit).</li>
        <li>Run retargeting ads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Retention.</h2>
      <p>Permit-related job records are kept 10 years per Colorado state electrical code. EV-charger install records are kept 5 years. Service-call notes are kept 3 years. Site analytics are aggregated after 30 days.</p>

      <h2>Your rights.</h2>
      <p>You can ask for a copy of any data we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it (subject to the records-retention windows above). Email <a href="mailto:shop@lumenelectric.example">shop@lumenelectric.example</a> with subject "Privacy" and Ray will respond inside 10 business days.</p>

      <h2>Contact.</h2>
      <p>Lumen Electric, 412 Linden St, Fort Collins, CO. <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
